  "title": "Native Dataverse Authorization (Public Preview) for Stronger Security in Power Pages",
  "summary": "We’re excited to introduce the public preview of Native Dataverse Authorization (Enhanced Authorization) in Power Pages. This release brings a significant advancement in how external user access is secured and managed. Authorization is now enforced directly within Dataverse, providing stronger security, improved visibility, and more precise control while keeping the maker experience unchanged.",
